Why Vite ♥ JavaScript Monorepos
Ema Zyka

JavaScript monorepos promise shared code, consistency, and easier collaboration but they often come with slow builds and complex setups. In this talk, we will explore why Vite fits naturally into modern JS monorepo workflows, how it helps teams stay productive as projects scale, and what a real setup looks like with shared libraries and multiple apps.

Ema Zyka is a Staff Software Engineer at Allwyn Lottery Solutions with over 15 years of experience in web development. She is also a co-organizer of the Vue.js Athens meetup. She enjoys building purposeful teams and fostering environments where experimentation, continuous learning and growth. Passionate about JavaScript, Ema has contributed to distributed and diverse teams as an engineer, lead, mentor, and collaborator, delivering end-to-end solutions across the stack.


